{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"7c760a2bc72d068ae2d801935f6357cc9831e33d6d8cda2a1fc690c49f99b0e9","ja":"紗代子の書きたいこと","zh":"纱代子想写的事","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"f92195f56c0580ebe487dc4dc66de2715c277e54ae805c37595222ec63e17e04","ja":"（今日の分のレポはこんな感じでいいかな。\n明後日は時間があるから、遠いお店にも行って……）","zh":"（今天的战报差不多这样就行了吧。\n后天有时间，再去远一点的店……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"76867601d5b4f16dce89756b2f6a5e660b3ae0ff7a8d3599945abddf7963e4e8","ja":"ん？　なんかいい香り……あ！\nたい焼きだ～！","zh":"嗯？好香的味道……啊！\n是鲷鱼烧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3701949ad6d92616d1d0f9955d2a4db85b5aac94a91dd2054f80373d85ddf513","ja":"さっき買ってきたんです。\nよかったらひとついかがですか？　温めなおしますね♪","zh":"这是我刚买回来的。\n不介意的话要来一个吗？我帮您重新加热一下吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bbad1ebe8cddc71f026a234a6f026bb27cd5e5d5ae5ff51d420ed36da2f572ec","ja":"わあっ、ありがと～！　もうお腹ぺこぺこでさ！\nでもいいの？　紗代子の同人誌の資料……なんだよね？","zh":"哇，谢谢～！肚子早就饿扁了！\n不过真的可以吃吗？这是纱代子同人志的资料……对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7ef8b8d06357eebeced467a66ce765e9234ddd341902d7fcad60e0fda0da19be","ja":"はい、写真も全部撮れていますから。あっ、でも端っこ\nまであんこが入っているかどうかは教えてください。","zh":"好的，照片也全都拍到了。啊，不过边角\n到底有没有包进豆沙馅，还请告诉我一声。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5949e7744cea77b584e2eb25e1cac49fee748e15551b76fec5cee5881cc1dcff","ja":"あはは、オッケーだよ！　今日は近場の\nたい焼き屋さんをまわって来たんだっけ？","zh":"啊哈哈，没问题哦！今天你好像是去逛了\n附近的鲷鱼烧店对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"01ac9a9a7bd2723ec0ae32f45d0420415fb1f55c4fb9e8b673ea901e358b5274","ja":"はい。私のテーマの『たい焼きレポ』……。","zh":"是的。我的主题是“鲷鱼烧体验报告”……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"99148932aa28365b081efe5d845a4dd539e52b28c43317315716e383a8287d88","ja":"できるだけたくさんのお店を紹介したいので、\n明後日は遠出をするつもりです。","zh":"因为想尽可能多介绍一些店，\n后天打算出一趟远门。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f1ad8b84af7e05230d6c82f73bf508fe6cfc1c298838a20044c7bdf4e0061aa8","ja":"けっこう大変そう……\nでも、楽しそうだね！","zh":"好像挺辛苦的……\n不过，感觉很有趣呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"50cb1b72152ee12d642e67d93ff5a988dffaa925f713a829b7d5373a0ff89709","ja":"そうなんです！　どんな風に書いたら\nお店の良さが伝わるか、考えるとワクワクして……。","zh":"就是这样！只要一想到怎样写\n才能传达出店里的优点，就兴奋不已……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"6beb89e93874cfb751eb4917c2200dabd78e8a27a21b400e29fab53a2d53754b","ja":"のり子さんの方は、どんな感じですか？","zh":"法子小姐那边情况怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"bd24e15039306a7764eb7b08725d2387f707a716d1033a9b665a32b8b41d7c3c","ja":"アタシも順調だよ～！　さっき●●●●プロデューサー\n相手に技を決めてきたとこ！","zh":"我也很顺利哦～！刚才拿●●●●制作人\n当对手使出招式了呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e70168e703b2cfd394bb8231ab51caaec9f297ed92d3a5da1bb39245a456f341","ja":"『のり子のプロレス初級講座』……わかりやすいように\nアングルとかすっごくこだわってて！","zh":"“法子的职业摔跤初学者讲座”……为了让人容易看懂，\n在拍摄角度之类的地方非常讲究！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ee3448896be170e60b04d4642c02ca9976640357fd88b1c3250c70d8fe23396b","ja":"しっかり技がキマりすぎたときは\nどうしようかと思ったけど……。","zh":"招式用得太完美的时候，\n我还以为要怎么办呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"a53bf265fe0e0334b8e87aef599fbd115259bbfeead45e1e9ba3dec2abc74af9","ja":"ええっ！？\n●●●●プロデューサー、大丈夫だったんですか！？","zh":"诶！？\n●●●●制作人，您没事吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"736cd381270408c7f703668f9049c79043972b6035f0df83a99fdc8b396fed3b","ja":"うん……平気って言ってたけど……\n後でお詫びに、何か差し入れするつもり。","zh":"嗯……虽然对方说没事……\n但之后我打算带点慰问品去赔礼道歉。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"14a464c29f3272dcfc3237aeeb16bdc874bec6dd99fe12b7ef1ba72292da2736","ja":"それじゃあ、たい焼きも一緒に食べましょうって\nお誘いしましょうか？","zh":"那我去邀请她们，\n问要不要一起吃鲷鱼烧吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"9f38a0df4e832c861f3e31fdb31ce885e61fb738cf8500583c4881734befacf1","ja":"本当？　ありがとう～！\nじゃあさっそく呼んでくるよ！","zh":"真的吗？太感谢啦～！\n那我这就去叫人过来！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1033.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"60cd26a4a1b0b151e5aa42c8db0264d66d179f9b1d147aa02340f6a5839854d1","ja":"●●●●プロデューサー！\nさっきはごめんね～～～～！","zh":"●●●●制作人！\n刚才对不起啦～～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
